1
00:00:00,532 --> 00:00:01,702
Chapter one.

2
00:00:01,722 --> 00:00:02,830
The claim.

3
00:00:03,225 --> 00:00:04,275
People say

4
00:00:04,295 --> 00:00:07,934
it takes twenty-one days to build a habit.

5
00:00:07,954 --> 00:00:09,064
Three findings

6
00:00:09,084 --> 00:00:11,017
tell a different story.

7
00:00:11,305 --> 00:00:12,425
In one study

8
00:00:12,445 --> 00:00:13,975
ninety-six people

9
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:15,717
tracked a new habit.

10
00:00:15,979 --> 00:00:18,169
A habit forms in three steps:

11
00:00:18,189 --> 00:00:18,849
a cue,

12
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:19,919
a routine,

13
00:00:19,939 --> 00:00:21,150
and a reward.

14
00:00:21,415 --> 00:00:23,265
Your phone on the desk

15
00:00:23,285 --> 00:00:24,815
pulls on attention,

16
00:00:24,835 --> 00:00:25,515
memory

17
00:00:25,535 --> 00:00:26,483
and mood.

18
00:00:26,745 --> 00:00:27,605
They say

19
00:00:27,625 --> 00:00:28,899
three weeks.

20
00:00:28,919 --> 00:00:30,099
Studies found

21
00:00:30,119 --> 00:00:31,616
about two months.

22
00:00:31,875 --> 00:00:33,245
Not twenty-one.

23
00:00:33,265 --> 00:00:34,617
Sixty-six days.

24
00:00:34,908 --> 00:00:36,450
The verdict: myth.

25
00:00:36,732 --> 00:00:37,562
Part two.

26
00:00:37,582 --> 00:00:38,517
The feed.

27
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:41,511
I opened one notification.

28
00:00:41,531 --> 00:00:43,117
An hour was gone.

29
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,630
An endless feed

30
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:46,117
has no last page.

31
00:00:46,394 --> 00:00:49,294
Every swipe promises something new:

32
00:00:49,314 --> 00:00:50,364
a funny clip,

33
00:00:50,384 --> 00:00:51,674
a strange story,

34
00:00:51,694 --> 00:00:52,517
big news.

35
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:55,089
Before you open it, ask:

36
00:00:55,109 --> 00:00:56,299
why am I here,

37
00:00:56,319 --> 00:00:57,684
and for how long?

38
00:00:57,954 --> 00:00:59,904
Sometimes the best swipe

39
00:00:59,924 --> 00:01:01,483
is closing the app.

40
00:01:01,752 --> 00:01:02,782
Count slowly

41
00:01:02,802 --> 00:01:04,916
from zero to one hundred.

42
00:01:05,198 --> 00:01:06,518
Three small steps:

43
00:01:06,538 --> 00:01:07,548
pick a time,

44
00:01:07,568 --> 00:01:08,588
set a limit,

45
00:01:08,608 --> 00:01:09,850
close the app.

46
00:01:10,124 --> 00:01:11,334
The real habit

47
00:01:11,354 --> 00:01:12,517
is noticing.

48
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,421
Thanks for watching.

